			],
			"Message": "docs(Mist): Document shim compatibility tier in Architecture.md\n\nAdd the Shim Compatibility section to the Mist Architecture document, recording\nthat Mist has no shim-specific interception modules of its own and routes all\nshim-layer events through Wind, Mountain, and Cocoon.\n\nThe table documents both tiers — 🟠 Low-Level (prototype hooks) and 🔵 Coverage\n(service routing) — alongside Mist's gating behind `TierShim` env var (default\n`None`, zero overhead).\n\nAligns the Mist architecture doc with the deep-shim system documentation\nreferenced at `/doc/low-level-shim`.",
